},{"pos":4822,"endPos":4834,"startLine":128,"startLineOffset":86,"endLine":128,"endLineOffset":98,"length":13}]}]},{"comment":"The message `\"visitQualifiedNamePatterns can only return UnresolvedNamePattern, UnresolvedStar or UnresolvedAttribute\"` lists `UnresolvedNamePattern` and `UnresolvedStar`, but those are already rejected by the preceding `if` block with a `ParsingException`. By the time the second check fires, the only \"expected\" type is `UnresolvedAttribute`. A message like `\"Expected UnresolvedAttribute but got \" + ne.getClass().getSimpleName()` would be more actionable for debugging.","nodes":[{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/parser/LogicalPlanBuilder.java-x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/parser/LogicalPlanBuilder.java-19967:19982,19998:20333-19962:19992,20006:20015,20031:20663","promptId":"#E2Y93","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/parser/LogicalPlanBuilder.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/parser/LogicalPlanBuilder.java","srcChanges":[{"pos":19967,"endPos":19982,"startLine":453,"startLineOffset":13,"endLine":453,"endLineOffset":28,"length":16},{"pos":19998,"endPos":20333,"startLine":453,"startLineOffset":44,"endLine":458,"endLineOffset":10,"length":336}],"dstChanges":[{"pos":19962,"endPos":19992,"startLine":453,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":453,"endLineOffset":38,"length":31},{"pos":20006,"endPos":20015,"startLine":454,"startLineOffset":13,"endLine":454,"endLineOffset":22,"length":10},{"pos":20031,"endPos":20663,"startLine":454,"startLineOffset":38,"endLine":464,"endLineOffset":10,"length":633}]}]},{"comment":"All three deserialization constructors use the pattern:\n```java\n(List\u003cAttribute\u003e) (List) in.readNamedWriteableCollectionAsList(NamedExpression.class)\n```\nBecause of type erasure, this cast always succeeds at the list level. A `ClassCastException` would only surface later when an element is actually used as an `Attribute`. If a plan serialized by an older version (or a different code path) contained a non-`Attribute` `NamedExpression` (e.g., a `Function` or `Literal`), the failure would be delayed and harder to diagnose. Consider adding a runtime validation loop after the cast:\n```java\nList\u003cAttribute\u003e matchFields \u003d (List\u003cAttribute\u003e) (List) in.readNamedWriteableCollectionAsList(NamedExpression.class);\nfor (Object e : matchFields) {\n    if (e instanceof Attribute \u003d\u003d false) {\n        throw new IllegalStateException(\"Expected Attribute but got \" + e.getClass().getSimpleName());\n    }\n}\n```\nThis converts a potentially confusing downstream `ClassCastException` into an immediate, descriptive error.","nodes":[{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/logical/join/JoinConfig.java-x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/logical/join/JoinConfig.java-1314:1374-1255:1285,1406:1491","promptId":"#6QJHN","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/logical/join/JoinConfig.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/logical/join/JoinConfig.java","srcChanges":[{"pos":1314,"endPos":1374,"startLine":31,"startLineOffset":12,"endLine":31,"endLineOffset":72,"length":61}],"dstChanges":[{"pos":1255,"endPos":1285,"startLine":29,"startLineOffset":4,"endLine":29,"endLineOffset":34,"length":31},{"pos":1406,"endPos":1491,"startLine":33,"startLineOffset":12,"endLine":33,"endLineOffset":97,"length":86}]},{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/physical/HashJoinExec.java-x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/physical/HashJoinExec.java-2106:2166-1894:1924,2129:2214","promptId":"#VJ465","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/physical/HashJoinExec.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elast